    "title": "Pacers bounce back to down Thunder for 2-1 NBA Finals lead - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Indianapolis, Indiana\nPacers bounce back to down Thunder for 2-1 NBA Finals lead\nBy AFP AFP,\n3 hours agoThe Indiana Pacers bounced back to defeat the Oklahoma City Thunder 116-107 and take a 2-1 series lead in the NBA Finals on Wednesday. Bennedict Mathurin scored 27 points off the bench and Tyrese Haliburton finished with 22 as the Pacers shrugged off Sunday's emphatic game-two loss to reignite their finals challenge.",
